OL,3,ASix Nigerians accused of romance scams
OL,4,Ato be extradited to the US
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth African police are handing over
OL,7,Fsix Nigerians wanted in the US for
OL,8,Falleged online romance scams to FBI
OL,9,Fagents later on Friday.
OL,11,FThe group is accused of targeting over
OL,12,F100 women in the US and defrauding them
OL,13,Fof more than 100m rand ($6m; #5m), the
OL,14,FSouth African authorities said.
OL,16,FThose being extradited were arrested in
OL,17,F2021 and are believed to be members of
OL,18,Fcrime syndicate Black Axe - a Nigerian
OL,19,Fmafia-style gang tied to human
OL,20,Ftrafficking, internet fraud and murder.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
