OL,3,ASix Nigerians accused of romance scams
OL,4,Ato be extradited to the US
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of their reported victims included
OL,7,Fpensioners and businesspeople "who were
OL,8,Ftargeted through sophisticated online
OL,9,Frelationships used to defraud them of
OL,10,Ftheir money", according to South
OL,11,FAfrica's elite Hawks police unit.
